1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,220
你好 先生 我是杜恩·贝利
Hey, sir. Duane Bailey, running for, uh,

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,900
准备参加镇议员改选
town council reelection.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:08,560
-别看 是杜恩·贝利那个混蛋 -唉 真衰
- Oh, don't look. There's that jerk Duane Bailey. - Oh, yuck.

4
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,040
你说我是不是该损损他
I should say something to him, shouldn't I?

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:12,263
实话说 我刚刚只是妇唱夫随
I gotta be honest, I was just walking off your tone.

6
00:00:12,274 --> 00:00:13,960
杜恩·贝利是谁 我们为什么要恨人家啊
Who's Duane Bailey and why do we hate him?

7
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,880
亲爱的 他就是否决我停车牌议案的那货
Honey, he's that councilman who shot down my stop sign.

8
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,120
-傻大缺 -没错
- Big phony - Yeah.

9
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,207
你好 我是杜恩·贝利 竞选市议员连任
Hey! Duane Bailey seeking reelection town council.

10
00:00:20,207 --> 00:00:22,100
希望你能投我一票哦
Hope I can count on your vote.

11
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,080
好啊 我一定投你
Well, you just got it.

12
00:00:23,384 --> 00:00:25,338
你不记得见过我 是吧
You don't remember meeting me,do you.

13
00:00:25,338 --> 00:00:28,366
克莱尔·邓菲 上个月镇会议上见过
Claire Dunphy,last month town council meeting.

14
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,520
哦 当然
Oh, yes I do.

15
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,280
我当然记得你
Yes I remember you.

16
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:34,560
给姐个停车牌
I want a stop sign.

17
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,460
开个玩笑啦 来 拿支笔吧
Just having fun. Here, have a pen.

18
00:00:39,114 --> 00:00:39,960
杜恩·贝利
"Duane bailey.

19
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,140
忠诚议员 良好市民 哈巴小猎犬爱好者
Councilman. Citizen. Puggle breeder."

20
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:43,280
我爱哈巴小猎犬
I love them.

21
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,240
因为那是种族大融合的产物
Because they're a different mix of breeds,

22
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,440
恰似美利坚合众国
just like America.

23
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,520
我很赞同他的话 克莱尔
I like what he's saying, Claire.

24
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:49,769
-他说的完全狗屁不通 -看这个
- He isn't saying anything. - Look at his...

25
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:52,440
我家路口需要立个停车牌
We need a stop sign at our intersection.

26
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,880
谁都想立停车牌
Everyone says that,

27
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,840
若是听之任之
But pretty soon,

28
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,160
我们就要"转角遇到停车牌"了
we're stopping at every single corner.

29
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:58,760
加拿大倒是停车牌遍布 在那儿开车多悲剧啊
Why don't you go ask Canada how that's working out?

30
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:01,063
-他真有才 -你好 我是杜恩·贝利
- He nailed it. - Hi. Duane bailey. Hi.

31
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:04,800
身兼演员编剧导演 铁拳勇猛谁敢争先
"Actor/writer/director who packs a punch."

32
00:01:04,948 --> 00:01:06,070
-是席尔维斯特·史泰龙 -席尔维斯特·史泰龙
- Oh, sylvester Stallone. - Sylvester Stallone.

33
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:06,760
我先说的
I said it first.

34
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:09,820
我的天啊
Oh, my god.

35
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:11,440
这人居然带孩子来 米奇尔
This guy brought his kids, Mitchell.

36
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,460
让孩子看这影片 这片子可是暴力无下限啊
What, to this movie? Isn't it supposed to be super violent?

37
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:17,180
抱歉 我不是想多管闲事 但是
I'm sorry. I don't mean to overstep, but I don't know

38
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:19,440
这部电影好像有点"少儿不宜"吧
that this movie is really appropriate for children.

39
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:21,880
我都不敢看 所以我们才挑白天来
I'm terrified to see it. That's why we're here during the day.

40
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:23,580
没事 我们受得了
It's okay. We're good.

41
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:25,800
好吧
Okay.

42
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:27,200
我尽力了
I tried.

43
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,860
是啊 尽你所能了
Yeah. All you can do.

44
00:01:30,170 --> 00:01:32,080
知道吗 我读过原著的
You know, I've--I've read this book,

45
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:35,040
知道大致剧情 的确很可怕
And I know what's gonna happen, and it's very disturbing.

46
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:36,660
我觉得 您这是自找罪受
I really think you might be inviting

47
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:38,320
想晚上做噩梦吧
some pretty serious nightmares here.

48
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:41,000
兄弟 听好 我的孩子我做主
Hey, buddy, they're my kids. I got it.

49
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:42,280
是吗 我可不觉得
Yeah, but I don't think you do.

50
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:44,440
小卡 小卡 他说了他做主
Cam. Cam. He says he's got it, all right?

51
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:47,120
你仁至义尽了 好好看电影吧
You said your piece. Just watch the movie.

52
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:49,760
是格温妮丝·帕特洛
Oh, uh, Gwyneth Paltrow.

53
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:52,320
-您真不该毒害您的孩子... -小卡
- I really must insist you not traumatize your kids... - Cam.

54
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,520
-不该让他们过早接触暴力影片 -别说了
- by exposing them to gratuitous violence... - Stop it. Shh!

55
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:57,280
-以及血腥影像 -爸爸 我吓到了
- and graphic depictions of-- - Daddy, I'm scared.

56
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,518
是啊 待会儿更吓死你
Yeah, well, you're gonna be.

57
00:01:58,518 --> 00:01:59,637
我最后警告你一次
I'm gonna tell you one more time.

58
00:01:59,637 --> 00:02:02,500
-不 是我最后警告你一次 -好了
- No, I'm gonna tell you one more time. - Okay.

59
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:03,620
人家看的电影是《布偶》
It was "The Muppet" Movie.

60
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,740
我们进错放映厅了
We were in the wrong theater.

61
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:10,600
好好看哦 我一直都很喜欢布偶系列的
Enjoy the show. I was always a fan of the Muppets,

62
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:12,140
尤其是那两个在剧场
Especially the two guys in the theater

63
00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:13,680
-喋喋不休的"好人" -赶紧走
- who wouldn't shut up. - Just leave.

64
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:30,980
-喂 -我要晚一点了
- Hello? - I'm running late.

65
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:33,320
那傻缺让我等了一个多小时
This knucklehead's kept me waiting for over an hour.

66
00:02:33,612 --> 00:02:36,547
他爸当权的时候 都没让我等这么久
I never had to wait like this when his dad was running things.

67
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:36,620
是啊
Yeah.

68
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,180
改朝换代政策变
And soda was a nickel.

69
00:02:38,191 --> 00:02:40,880
直接告诉他 你家人要来参加家庭聚会
Just tell them that your family is coming over.

70
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:42,240
那货把他老爸都给炒了
This guy fired his own father.

71
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,720
他才不会鸟我的什么家人呢
He's not gonna care about my family.

72
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,060
那你就直接走呗
Okay, then just leave.

73
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,440
你又不需要他的钱
You don't need his money.

74
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,540
每个礼拜 都有八张嘴
Once a week, I have eight family members

75
00:02:48,540 --> 00:02:50,080
来咱家白吃白喝
coming to my house for free food.

76
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:51,140
我走不起
I'm not going anywhere.

77
00:02:51,580 --> 00:02:53,840
行 那就回家再见吧
Okay. I see you when I see you.

78
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,680
你怎么了 出什么事了吗
Are you okay? What is wrong?

79
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,280
我真想在家自学
I want to be homeschooled.

80
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:03,580
当真吗 曼尼 你想让我"学"你英语吗
Really, Manny? Do you want me to learn you English?

81
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,040
到底怎么了
What is going on?

82
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,820
有份报告要做
I have a big report due,

83
00:03:06,820 --> 00:03:08,700
但老师根本不在乎文章内容
And the teachers don't seem to care about the substance.

84
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,340
他们只重视花巧外表
All they care about is the flash.

85
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:13,280
曼尼啊 有时候你有点守旧
Manny, sometimes you can be a little bit old-fashioned.

86
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,780
还记得你第一次
Remember the first time

87
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:17,080
看见小朋友用滑轮背包时
you saw the kids with the backpacks with wheels

88
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,580
你还觉得太花哨
and you thought they were too flashy?

89
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,180
我是去上学 又不是游轮丹佛行
You're going to school, not boarding a flight to Denver.

90
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,600
真是荒谬
It's getting absurd.

91
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:25,620
雷本那篇爱尔兰移民研究报告 纯属东拼西凑
Reuben freestyle-rapped his report on Irish immigrants.

92
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:26,880
那东西根本狗屁不通
That doesn't even make sense.

93
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:29,385
即便他跳了个大河之舞 又怎样
Maybe you do a Riverdance. Maybe.

94
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,640
-报告是什么主题 -黑手党
- What is your report on? - The Mafia.

95
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:35,240
太好了 我们做个冲锋枪纸模
Perfect. We do a papier-mache Tommy gun.

96
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,900
不 我们不搞那些花里胡哨的
Oh, no. We shouldn't have to jazz it up.

97
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,420
那好 我们去楼上把你的旧木马拿来
Okay, then we go upstairs and we get your old rocking horse

98
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:40,460
斩首示众
and we chop the head off.

99
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:42,860
不 太残忍了 我喜欢布朗尼
No, that's a terrible idea. I love Brownie!

100
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,700
你到底想不想"杀马震师"啊
Do you want to send a message or not?

101
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,240
杰从不让我插手他的生意
Jay never wants me to help him with his business,

102
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:52,500
突然间 曼尼也不听我的话了
And now suddenly, manny doesn't want to listen to me either.

103
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:54,127
真让老娘郁闷啊
It's very frustrating.

104
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,660
老娘可是万事通
I have all the answers.

105
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,600
嘿 你来了
Hey! There he is.

106
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:01,080
-快进来 杰 -你好吗 乔小希
- Bring it in , Jay. How you doing, Joshie?

107
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,160
-还是叫我乔希吧 -请坐
- It's Josh now. - Have a seat.

108
00:04:04,283 --> 00:04:04,886
那好
Ah, all right.

109
00:04:04,886 --> 00:04:06,940
我大概看了一下你的方案
So I flipped through your proposal,

110
00:04:06,940 --> 00:04:08,480
是这样...
And here's the thing--

111
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:11,600
我们的超规模豪华复合式公寓 开建在即
We're about to build our largest luxury condo complex yet.

112
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,440
有个重要的问题要问你
And I have an important question for you--

113
00:04:13,980 --> 00:04:15,380
你想要构筑什么
what is it you want to build?

114
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,580
壁橱
Closets.

115
00:04:19,477 --> 00:04:21,967
你看 我指望你会说"构筑梦想"呢
See, I was kinda hoping you'd say "Dreams."

116
00:04:22,281 --> 00:04:23,996
我暗含那个意思
I thought that was implied.

117
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:27,400
杰 我的壁橱可要是空前绝后的
Jay, I'm looking for closets nobody's ever seen before,

118
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,840
惊艳之作
You know, a big "Wow!"

119
00:04:29,220 --> 00:04:29,820
明白我的意思吗
You know what I'm saying?

120
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,580
你追求的是上好的壁橱
You want a nice closet with sharp design,

121
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:33,720
要设计新锐 质量上乘 做工精湛
quality materials, and expert craftsmanship.

122
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:37,060
不止如此 我还要它举世皆惊
Uh, I mean, I want it to be like, bam!

123
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:39,320
大家走进来然后说
You know, people are gonna walk in there and go

124
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:41,962
"哇 先挂哪件好呢"
"Whoa! What do I hang first?"

125
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:43,620
先挂了我吧
I wanted to hang myself.

126
00:04:44,164 --> 00:04:46,560
谈点详细的吧
Yeah, let's talk more specific.

127
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,880
您的喜厌好恶到底怎样
What exactly do you like and what don't you like?

128
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,599
好吧 有道理
All right, fair enough. Uh...

129
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:53,900
我不喜欢谈细节 很不爽
I don't like this. This makes me sad.

130
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,860
我喜欢奇思妙想
I do like getting my mind blown.

131
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,520
你的狂热我很欣赏
I love your enthusiasm.

132
00:04:58,982 --> 00:05:01,426
为免我思路偏差 不合你意
Uh, before I go off in the wrong direction,

133
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,000
给个例子行吗
How about an example?

134
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:03,820
好吧 听着
All right, check this out.

135
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:06,040
三周前 我去南部海滩度假
So, like, three weeks ago, I'm down in South Beach.

136
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:08,228
我走进摇滚俱乐部
I walk into this thumpin' club.

137
00:05:08,228 --> 00:05:10,489
酒保问我"你要喝什么"
Bartender says, "What do you wanna drink?"

138
00:05:10,500 --> 00:05:12,120
我说"给我个惊喜"
I say, "Wow me."

139
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:15,120
他调了杯酒 我就喝了一小口
He mixes this thing together. I take one sip,

140
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:17,140
再醒来时 我说"护士姐姐好"
and I'm like, "Hello, nurse!"

141
00:05:17,140 --> 00:05:20,080
护士告诉我 "你已经昏迷两天了"
And she's like, "You've been unconscious for two days."

142
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,360
我的壁橱要的就是这个感觉
That's what I want in a closet.

143
00:05:23,003 --> 00:05:24,887
我想我不需要再听了
I don't think I need to hear any more.

144
00:05:29,773 --> 00:05:31,689
你干啥呢 做作业吗
Whatcha doing there? Homework?

145
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:32,660
有话快说
What do you want?

146
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:35,920
我想借点钱 江湖救急
I need to borrow some money. It's really important.

147
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:37,140
借多少
How much?

148
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:40,280
什么
What?!

149
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:42,320
拜托了 如果你遇到困难
Come on. If you were in trouble,

150
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:44,120
我会倾囊相助的
I would do anything for you.

151
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,140
我们是姐妹以上
We're not just sisters.

152
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:48,440
闺蜜已满啊
We're best friends.

153
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:52,820
不是我不帮
Look, I would if I could,

154
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:54,220
我是真的没钱啊
but I don't have any money.

155
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,160
既然话都说开了
And since we're talking,

156
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,965
我就老实说吧 那谁谁
I never told anyone this before, and it...

157
00:06:00,100 --> 00:06:03,100
别蠢脸堆笑充市花了
...wipe that smug smile off his stupid face.

158
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:04,500
他那张脸是够蠢
His face is stupid.

159
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:08,120
这种跳梁小丑竟能当上公务员
Oh! I can't believe ridiculous people like him end up in office.

160
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,800
你为什么不参选呢
Well, why don't you run?

161
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:12,200
你聪明过人 关爱社区
You're smart, you care about the community,

162
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:15,460
稍微打扮下 也蛮有红颜铁娘子风范
and you're easy on the eyes when you put a little effort into it.

163
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,900
-说真的吗 -是啊
- Are you serious? - Yeah, you know,

164
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:19,660
别整天穿着汗湿的运动装就行
maybe change out of the sweaty gym clothes every once in while.

165
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:22,304
我知道 你是问参选那句吗
I thought you were talking about running for office.

166
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:22,800
接着说
Go on.

167
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,380
说没想过肯定是骗人
I'd be lying if I said I'd never thought about it.

168
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:27,540
我知道那只是个芝麻官
I mean, I know it's a ridiculous little local thing,

169
00:06:27,540 --> 00:06:29,980
但踏出家门 奉献市民 也未尝不好
but it might be fun to get out there and contribute.

170
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:31,440
再说 我觉得自己能够胜任
Plus I think I'd be good at it.

171
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:34,160
-你一定很出色 -但如何能行呢
- You'd be great. - Mm. How would this work?

172
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:36,720
孩子放学后谁照顾
I mean, who would be here for the kids after school?

173
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:39,180
谁带他们去排练 去朗诵会
Who would take them to practice and recitals

174
00:06:39,180 --> 00:06:41,220
阻止他们上房揭瓦呢
and keep them from burning the house down?

175
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,900
"单亲妈妈"真心不容易
It must be so hard being a single mom.

176
00:06:45,060 --> 00:06:46,180
克莱尔 有你老公在呢
Claire, I will.

177
00:06:47,701 --> 00:06:48,540
如果你想高飞
If you wanna fly,

178
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:50,580
我绝不扯你后腿
I'm not gonna hold your feet to the ground. Hmm.

179
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:52,480
我会助力一臂 推你离地
I wanna be the one to push you off the cliff.

180
00:06:54,048 --> 00:06:55,640
我决定了
I think I'm gonna do it.

181
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,080
很好
Great.

182
00:06:56,591 --> 00:06:58,181
-飞吧 -菲尔
- Go fly. - Phil.

183
00:06:58,181 --> 00:07:00,248
-天啊 -菲尔
- No. - Oh, phil!

184
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:03,560
我得承认 我就是女强人控
I'll admit it. I'm turned on by powerful women--

185
00:07:03,740 --> 00:07:06,320
米歇尔·奥巴马 奥普拉 康多莉扎·赖斯
Michelle Obama, Oprah, Condoleezza Rice,

186
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:07,780
塞雷娜·威廉姆斯[小威廉姆斯]
Serena Williams--

187
00:07:08,060 --> 00:07:09,720
慢着 不对[菲尔提到的都是黑人]
Wait a minute.

188
00:07:13,380 --> 00:07:15,420
-要吃薯条吗 -不要 我吃不下
- Do you want a fry? - No, I can't eat.

189
00:07:15,420 --> 00:07:17,620
我们还不如留下来看《布偶》
We should've stayed and seen "The Muppets."

190
00:07:17,620 --> 00:07:19,400
我现在一看番茄酱 还觉得满目血腥
I can't even look at ketchup without seeing blood.

191
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,560
漏网卷薯条 好运的象征
Ooh, runaway curly fry. You know these are good luck.

192
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:28,160
-天啊 怎么回事 -追尾了
- Oh, my god. What was that? - We just got rear-ended.

193
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:30,080
靠边停车 靠边停车
Oh, pull off to the side street. Pull off to the side street.

194
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:32,860
-你还好吗 -上牙膛被吸管划破了
- Are you okay? - Oh, I think I cut the roof of my mouth on the straw.

195
00:07:32,860 --> 00:07:33,938
-我的老天 -所以说没事咯
- Oh, my god. Mm! - So yes.

196
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,400
天啊
Oh, boy.

197
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:40,820
真抱歉 都是我的错
I am so sorry. This is all my fault.

198
00:07:40,820 --> 00:07:41,500
你们还好吗
Are you guys okay?

199
00:07:41,500 --> 00:07:44,452
我嘴里受了点小伤
W-well, I-I sustained a minor mouth injury.

200
00:07:44,828 --> 00:07:45,900
我们没事 谢谢
We're fine. Thank you. It's...

201
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:47,220
我真过意不去
Look, I feel terrible.

202
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:49,100
别担心 我来处理这件事
Um, don't worry. I'm gonna take care of everything.

203
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:50,400
我去拿保险单
Let me just get my insurance info.

204
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,928
好的 谢谢
Okay. Thank you.

205
00:07:51,980 --> 00:07:53,000
这个人不错啊
Well, he seems nice.

206
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,060
按浪漫喜剧片标准情节
You know, if this were a romantic comedy,

207
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:56,160
这就是我和他的意外邂逅
this would be our meet cute.

208
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,960
我们一起打发这个午后
We'd spend the rest of the afternoon

209
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,920
喝喝小酒 吃点小饭
drinking wine, eating food,

210
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,940
放风筝 此处蒙太奇慢放
flying a kite, you know, doing montage-y stuff.

211
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,240
我在你的电影里吗
Yeah, am I in this movie of yours?

212
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,400
在啊 你是我的"盖蜜"
Yeah, you're the gay best friend.

213
00:08:05,700 --> 00:08:07,380
-我的天 -我的天 这货逃逸了
- Oh, my god! - Oh, my god! We have a runner!

214
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:09,540
车牌是D W Y 我看不清了
Um, it's d-w-y-- I can't read it.

215
00:08:09,540 --> 00:08:11,240
-快点 跑啊 -跑去哪
- Come on! Let's go! Let's go! - Go where?

216
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:13,660
-我们得去追他 -不能这么做
- We have to chase him down! - No, we're not supposed to do that!

217
00:08:13,900 --> 00:08:14,980
来人啊 拦住那辆车
Help! Stop that car!

218
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:17,380
他逃逸了 来人啊
He's getting away! Help!

219
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:20,200
马上就追到了 小卡 马上就追到了
Yeah, you almost got him, Cam. You almost got him.

220
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:21,460
他逃逸了
He's getting away!

221
00:08:25,822 --> 00:08:27,565
你干啥呢 玩游戏吗
Whatcha doing? Playing?

222
00:08:28,100 --> 00:08:28,500
是啊
Yeah.

223
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:31,580
你有存私房钱吗
Do you have any money saved up?

224
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,040
小康生活吧
I'm comfortable.

225
00:08:34,980 --> 00:08:37,020
我攒了1217美元
I've saved $1,217.

226
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,340
不费吹灰之力
It wasn't even that hard.

227
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,700
别忘了带午餐
Don't forget your lunch.

228
00:08:41,780 --> 00:08:42,420
谢了 老妈
Thanks, mom.

229
00:08:43,820 --> 00:08:45,400
午餐钱拿好 兄弟
Don't forget your lunch money, buddy.

230
00:08:45,860 --> 00:08:46,480
谢了 老爸
Thanks, dad.

231
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:47,320
那当然
You bet.

232
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,260
求你了 我真是急需用钱
Please. It's really important.

233
00:08:54,780 --> 00:08:56,980
我是真想帮你
Look, I'd love to help you out,

234
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:58,760
可我最近周转不灵
but I'm not very liquid right now.

235
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,400
钱都冻在冰砖里了
It's in a block of ice.

236
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,800
我听说过
I got the idea

237
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:04,660
有钱人"冻结资产"的事 灵光一现
when I heard about rich guys with frozen assets.

238
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:07,640
资产啊
Assets.

239
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:13,520
我准备参选市政议员
I am running for town council,

240
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:16,500
申请表是在这领吧
and I understand that I can pick up a form here.

241
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:17,640
去4楼
Fourth floor.

242
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:19,108
电梯在大厅那边
Elevator down the hall.

243
00:09:19,108 --> 00:09:21,806
碧昂丝 你怎么来这上班了
Beyonce, when'd you start working here?

244
00:09:22,106 --> 00:09:25,373
又是杜恩 他老说这些俏皮话
Oh, Duane. He's always saying stuff like that.

245
00:09:25,528 --> 00:09:27,668
我是杜恩·贝利 正在竞选连任
Duane Bailey. Running for reelection.

246
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:28,660
真是贵人多忘事
You're joking.

247
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:31,020
我们两小时前才在停车场见过
I just saw you in the parking lot two hours ago.

248
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:33,180
原来是你啊
Oh, hey. It's you!

249
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,060
怎么是你啊
Oh, it's you.

250
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,140
你 来这儿干嘛
What... Are you doing here?

251
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:38,280
我也要参加镇议会的选举
I am entering the race for town council,

252
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:40,020
我要和你唱对台戏
and I am running against you.

253
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:42,720
好吧 真是勇气可嘉
Oh. Well, don't you have pluck.

254
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,940
不 我志在必得 所以
No, I plan on winning, so...

255
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:45,160
我猜你就这么想
Oh, yeah, I bet you do.

256
00:09:45,220 --> 00:09:47,340
玛莎 打扮得不错啊 爱死了
Marcia! Rocking the bangs! Love it.

257
00:09:47,460 --> 00:09:49,400
你知道吗 为何世上小狗千千万
Do you know why, of all the dogs in the world,

258
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:50,280
我独爱哈巴小猎犬
I breed puggles?

259
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:52,660
我怎么感觉 你又要借物喻人了
Why do I feel like this is a rhetorical question,

260
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:54,540
-接着你就要 -因为他们不光讨人爱
- And you're about to l-- - It's because they're lovable, yes,

261
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:57,540
还是顽强的猎手 不咬死猎物
but they're also tenacious hunters who won't quit

262
00:09:57,540 --> 00:09:59,160
誓不罢休
until the kill is complete.

263
00:09:59,300 --> 00:10:01,320
真的吗 我倒是觉得他们老是汪个不停
Really? 'cause I feel like they just yip a lot.

264
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:03,160
女士 你会一败涂地的
Look, lady, you're going down.

265
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:04,820
我六次选举一路全胜
I've won six straight elections.

266
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:06,760
我可不会输给居里闲人
I don't plan on losing to some bored housewife,

267
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:09,720
接着当主妇吧 小心失业
so don't quit your lack of a day job.

268
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,080
你给我站住
Excuse me!

269
00:10:12,420 --> 00:10:13,380
你给我站住
Excuse me!

270
00:10:14,860 --> 00:10:15,800
您请等一下
Excuse me.

271
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:17,880
喂
Hello?

272
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:19,620
是安妮啊
Anne.

273
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:22,600
海莉真干得出来
Haley did that?

274
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:26,060
天啊 好吧
Oh, god. Okay. Um...

275
00:10:26,700 --> 00:10:28,060
我一会再打给你
I'll call you right back.

276
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,020
您有必要知道 先生
For your information, sir,

277
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:32,220
我才不是居里闲人
I am no bored housewife.

278
00:10:32,220 --> 00:10:36,445
我是想闲闲不下来呢 指示灯怎么还不亮
No, I-I would kill for "Bored." Why isn't this lighting up?

279
00:10:36,607 --> 00:10:39,162
因为这是员工专用
Oh, it's because it's, uh, staff only.

280
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:39,480
没错
Yeah.

281
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,060
来 请允许我
Here. Allow me to...

282
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,380
不为你效劳了
Not get that for you.

283
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:45,460
祝你好运
Good luck!

284
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:51,700
老爸 我把胳膊划伤了
Dad, I cut my arm.

285
00:10:51,700 --> 00:10:53,740
划得够深的呀 老弟
Oh, wow. You sure did, buddy.

286
00:10:54,220 --> 00:10:55,360
我来帮你处理
I'll get you fixed up.

287
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:56,980
老妈去哪儿了
Where's mom?

288
00:10:57,380 --> 00:10:59,200
她现在属于人民群众了
She belongs to the people now.

289
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:01,880
我的过敏症又犯了
My allergies are acting up again.

290
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:04,560
今天你走运了
Well, it is your lucky day,

291
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,920
因为呢 小姐
Because, missy,

292
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:09,780
医生老爹应有尽有
Dr. Dad has everything you need.

293
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:13,860
瞧这葡萄味灵丹圣水的魔力吧
Behold the healing powers of grape flavoring.

294
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:14,800
妈妈去哪儿了
Where's mom?

295
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:16,180
她移情别"人"了
Some people took her.

296
00:11:16,260 --> 00:11:16,980
喝了
Drink this.

297
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:19,800
孩子们 你妈妈现在除了家务之外
Listen, guys, your mom is taking on more responsibilities

298
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:22,420
还另有职责
outside of the... house,

299
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:24,020
不过别担心
But don't you worry.

300
00:11:24,264 --> 00:11:28,127
金牌奶爸全 我的妈呀
Good old... Dad-- oh, my goodness!

301
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:29,300
对不起
I'm so sorry!

302
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,660
你打到我了
You punched me!

303
00:11:30,780 --> 00:11:32,780
爸 你给我的是催睡型的
Dad, you gave me the drowsy kind.

304
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,440
过敏药还有催睡型的吗
There's a drowsy kind?!

305
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:36,313
我还要复习备考呢
I have to study for a test!

306
00:11:36,354 --> 00:11:37,720
真的好痛啊
Oh! It really hurts!

307
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,860
-我帮你找点冰块 -别 别 别
- Well, I'll get you some ice. - No. No, no, no.

308
00:11:39,860 --> 00:11:40,980
我自己来吧
I'll get it.

309
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:48,820
你总算赶上了 事情办得怎么样
Oh, you made it. How was it?

310
00:11:49,363 --> 00:11:50,740
怎么了 出什么事了 亲爱的
Why? What's wrong, babe?

311
00:11:50,740 --> 00:11:53,280
-我不想说这个 -说来听听嘛
- I don't want to talk about it. - Do it anyways.

312
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:55,960
那倒霉孩子十分钟就把我打发了
Uh, this stupid kid's been in the business about ten minutes.

313
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:57,580
他基本上没看我的方案
He barely looks at my proposal,

314
00:11:57,580 --> 00:11:59,360
还说他想要"惊艳之作"
and he says he wants more "Wow."

315
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,420
他所谓的"惊艳"是什么
What does he mean by more "Wow"?

316
00:12:01,420 --> 00:12:03,680
是种典型"比伯式"美化说法
It's the "Bieber-ization" of America.

317
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:05,080
关水獭什么事
What do beavers have to do with anything?

318
00:12:05,300 --> 00:12:07,600
水獭啊 他们全国到处修水坝
The beavers--they build the dams all over the country

319
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,760
使美国免遭洪灾
so there's no floods,

320
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:11,022
这就是美国的水獭化
is the "Beaver-ization" Of the Americas.

321
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:14,320
我们之间的共同语言越来越少
I'm finding there's less and less we can talk about.

322
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:17,120
那你怎么不告诉他
So why didn't you tell him

323
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:19,040
你干这行经验丰富
that you've been in the business for such a long time--

324
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:20,420
说了也没用
It's not gonna make any difference.

325
00:12:20,420 --> 00:12:21,460
他一心想要改革
He wants to make a change.

326
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:24,140
全工厂上下都要靠这个单子养活
And I got a factory full of people depending on this.

327
00:12:24,260 --> 00:12:25,980
-不然你就告诉他 -拜托 歌洛莉亚
- Yeah, but maybe if you tell him that -- - Gloria, please.

328
00:12:25,980 --> 00:12:27,800
我今天很不顺
I-I-I've had a tough day.

329
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:29,300
先不谈这事了好吗
Can we please not talk about it?

330
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,700
可人家想帮你嘛
But I want to help.

331
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:32,260
相信我 我倒希望你能帮上忙
Trust me. I wish you had the answers.

332
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,200
我能的
I do!

333
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:36,140
-各位 -外公好
- Hey, guys. - Hey, grandpa.

334
00:12:36,173 --> 00:12:38,314
-你好啊 杰 -她怎么了
- Hey, Jay. - What's with her?

335
00:12:38,357 --> 00:12:40,311
只是困了 青春期嗜睡
Just tired. Growth spurt.

336
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:43,720
-大家好啊 -嗨 小姑娘
- Hi, guys. - Hi, baby girl.

337
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:47,000
莉莉 你好嘛
Hola, Lily. How are you?

338
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,140
大爸二爸吵架了
Dads are fighting.

339
00:12:48,190 --> 00:12:49,720
没有 我们没吵架
No, uh, we're not fighting.

340
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,940
宝贝 绝对没有
No, not at all, honey.

341
00:12:50,940 --> 00:12:52,718
没吵架 宝贝 玩去吧 好吗
No. Okay, uh, go play, sweetheart. Okay?

342
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:54,760
我们玩积木去吧 堆积木去
Let's go play with some blocks. Let's go stack some blocks.

343
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:57,180
好吧 我们之所以吵架是因为
All right. Okay, the reason we're fighting

344
00:12:57,180 --> 00:12:59,000
他竟然自以为是警探哈里
is 'cause this one thinks he's dirty Harry.

345
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:01,020
真难想象伊斯特伍德穿你身上那样的丑衬衫
Having a hard time picturing Clint Eastwood in that shirt.

346
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,280
好 我问问你
Okay, let me ask you something.

347
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:05,300
今天 有个家伙在红灯时撞了我们的车
Today, at a stoplight, a guy ran into our car,

348
00:13:05,300 --> 00:13:06,500
然后肇事潜逃
and then just took off.

349
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:08,660
我想去追他 而米奇尔
I wanted to chase after him. Mitchell...

350
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,480
很淡定地报了警
kept a level head and called the police.

351
00:13:11,220 --> 00:13:14,560
切 警察 他们不都忙着扫黄禁药吗
Pfft. Police. Aren't they too busy winning the war on drugs?

352
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:17,300
你们评评理 我们俩谁的处理方法正确
Okay, so which one of us did the right thing?

353
00:13:17,300 --> 00:13:19,380
肇事逃逸 必须追捕
Hit and run. Gotta chase him down.

354
00:13:19,380 --> 00:13:21,000
我成天就追着人跑
I chase the people all the time.

355
00:13:21,056 --> 00:13:22,936
不不 那样既不负责任 又危险
No. No. That's--that's irresponsible and dangerous.

356
00:13:22,936 --> 00:13:24,900
好吧 要是他有枪怎么办
Okay, well, what if he had been armed?

357
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:26,700
他车尾贴着希拉里的头像 肯定是个禁枪派
He wasn't armed. He had a Hillary bumper sticker.

358
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:28,980
不只这一回
This isn't an isolated incident.

359
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:31,320
今早他看布偶电影时还冲别人发疯
This morning he flipped out at somebody at the muppet movie.

360
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:34,160
你们撇下我去看布偶电影吗
You saw the muppet movie without me?

361
00:13:34,220 --> 00:13:34,920
不是的
Oh, no.

362
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:36,820
宝贝 不是的 我们是进错影厅看错片了
No, honey. Just the first two numbers.

363
00:13:36,820 --> 00:13:38,000
莉莉 不是的
No, lily. Wait.

364
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,820
大家好 菲尔 你在哪儿 宝贝
Hi. Hi. Hi. Phil, where are you, honey?

365
00:13:39,820 --> 00:13:42,140
有事跟你谈 你知道咱女儿闯什么祸了吗
I need to talk to you. Do you know what our daughter did?

366
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,880
没啥 她很好 在看书呢
Nothing. She's fine. She's reading.

367
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:46,100
不是她 是海莉 海莉给我出来
No, not her. Haley. Haley!

368
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:48,480
-过来 我有话问你 -她在这儿呢
- Come over here. I want to talk to you. -There she is.

369
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:49,900
没缺胳膊少腿
Not a scratch on her.

370
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,420
你有什么要告诉我们的吗
Do you have something you want to say to us?

371
00:13:51,420 --> 00:13:54,321
-这个... -让我帮你说吧
- Uh... - Mm... Let me help you out here.

372
00:13:54,970 --> 00:13:56,431
伪造身份证
Fake ID's?

373
00:13:56,431 --> 00:13:58,080
-什么 -正是
- What?! - Mm-hmm.

374
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:00,660
海莉想给自己和她朋友弄些假身份证
Haley tried to get her and her friends some fake ID's.

375
00:14:00,660 --> 00:14:03,520
我买假身份证不是为了买酒
I wasn't gonna use them for drinking.

376
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:05,900
我们只是想去酒吧看场乐队表演
We just wanted to get into this club to see a band.

377
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:09,340
她收了他们一笔钱 然后弄丢了
She took a bunch of money from them and then she lost it.

378
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:11,280
-多少钱啊 -900美元
- How much? - $900.

379
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:13,397
-我的天 -开什么玩笑
- Oh, my god! Oh! - You're kidding me!

380
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:14,780
真不怨我
It's not my fault!

381
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:17,740
我把钱给了那家伙 他把我们给忽悠了
I gave money to this guy. He's the one who ripped us off.

382
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:18,980
你的脸怎么了
What happened to your face?

383
00:14:19,457 --> 00:14:22,250
-噢 我撞门上了 -是啊
- Oh. I ran into a door. - Yeah.

384
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,820
-你的脸怎么了 -老爸打的
- What happened to your face? - Dad hit me.

385
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:25,800
纯属意外
It was an accident.

386
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:28,134
-菲尔 -我当时是想撕开创可贴
- Phil! - I was trying to open up a band-aid!

387
00:14:29,220 --> 00:14:30,060
她怎么了
What's wrong with her?

388
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:32,200
-青春期嗜睡吧 -到底怎么了
- Growth spurt. - What's wrong with her?

389
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,080
-我给她下药了 -菲尔
- I drugged her. - Phil!

390
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:36,280
我不小心给她吃了夜间服用的过敏药
I accidentally gave her the nighttime allergy medicine.

391
00:14:36,280 --> 00:14:38,660
好吧 先一桩桩的来
Mm. All right, one thing at a time.

392
00:14:38,660 --> 00:14:41,460
海莉 你打算如何把钱还给你朋友
Haley, how are you going to repay your friends?

393
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:42,480
我不知道
I don't know.

394
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:44,920
我知道 你带上几个弟兄去找他
I know. You go there with a couple of guys--

395
00:14:44,940 --> 00:14:46,840
她会把钱拿回来的 那小鬼是谁
She's gotta get the money back. Who is this kid?

396
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:49,860
是我同学表哥的朋友 他住在加迪纳
A guy at school's cousin's friend. He lives in Gardena.

397
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:51,860
知道他的老巢在哪儿还不简单 报警就是了
Well, if you know where he lives, just call the police.

398
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:54,440
不能报警 咱家现在不能有丑闻
No cops. We can't afford a scandal right now.

399
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:56,580
克莱尔要竞选镇议员呢
Claire's running for town council.

400
00:14:56,780 --> 00:14:57,720
那是之前
That was before,

401
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,700
我以为你能照顾好孩子们
when I thought you could take care of the children.

402
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:01,720
我就一小会儿没盯着孩子
I take my eye off the ball for one minute,

403
00:15:01,740 --> 00:15:04,100
他们就一个倒地不起 一个变熊猫眼
and I've got one in a coma, one with a black eye,

404
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,240
还有一个在组织犯罪团伙
and one running a crime ring.

405
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:08,360
说句公道话 海莉的"小犯罪团伙"
Well, to be fair, Haley started her crime ring

406
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,820
早在你盯着的时候就已经开始形成了
when your eye was still on the ball.

407
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:11,940
那可不是犯罪团伙
It's not a crime ring.

408
00:15:11,940 --> 00:15:14,422
我就是想拿回我那九百元
I just gotta get my hands on that $900.

409
00:15:14,422 --> 00:15:16,263
我知道黑手党一般怎么解决这事儿
I know how the mafia would handle this.

410
00:15:18,020 --> 00:15:21,020
孩子说得对 我最讨厌那些小混混
The kid is right. I'm sick of these smart-ass punks

411
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:22,020
出尔反尔 乱了道上规矩
who keep changing the rules

412
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:23,540
目中无人 自以为凌驾一切
and think they can get away with anything they want.

413
00:15:23,936 --> 00:15:25,460
我要去会会那家伙
I'm gonna pay this guy a visit.

414
00:15:25,460 --> 00:15:26,560
海莉 把他地址发给我
Haley, text me his address.

415
00:15:26,660 --> 00:15:27,820
-我和你一起去 -我也去
- I'm going with you. - Me, too.

416
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:29,620
不不 谁也不能去
Oh, no. No. Nobody's going anywhere.

417
00:15:29,660 --> 00:15:31,040
咱又不是治安队的
Okay, we're not vigilantes.

418
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:31,860
带上枪
Shotgun!

419
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:33,680
不 别抄家伙啊
No! No weapons!

420
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:41,400
按我老家的传统
In my country, it is tradition

421
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:43,260
当男人出门寻仇时
when the men are out seeking vengeance,

422
00:15:43,292 --> 00:15:45,848
女人们就在家喝酒
The women--they stay home, and they drink.

423
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:47,840
有时我觉得你纯粹是胡编乱造的
Sometimes I think you just make this stuff up.

424
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:49,580
-你到底要不要来一瓶 -乐意至极
- Do you want a drink or not? - Oh, yeah.

425
00:15:51,060 --> 00:15:52,360
到底是怎么回事
So what happened?

426
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:55,300
你本来要去竞选 现在又不干了吗
You were running for office, and now you're not?

427
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:57,620
我不太想谈这个
Mm. I don't really want to talk about that.

428
00:15:57,620 --> 00:16:00,700
我就知道 我受够不被人需要的感觉了
I know. I am sick and tired of no one needing my help.

429
00:16:00,700 --> 00:16:02,704
你得告诉我出什么岔子了
You are going to tell me what is wrong,

430
00:16:02,704 --> 00:16:04,480
而我会告诉你怎么解决
and I'm gonna give you the right answer,

431
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:06,160
因为我是万事通
because I have all of them.

432
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:09,000
说 你怎么又不去竞选了
So why are you not running for office?

433
00:16:09,660 --> 00:16:11,440
因为我的家人缺了我不行
Because my family needs me too much.

434
00:16:11,540 --> 00:16:12,660
你刚也看到我们家的各种乱子了
You saw what just happened.

435
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,500
你怎么又不去竞选了
Why are you not running for office?

436
00:16:14,538 --> 00:16:16,290
这招对我可没用
That doesn't work on me.

437
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:18,120
你怎么又不去竞选
Why are you not running for office?!

438
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:19,860
因为 我不想输
Because I don't want to lose!

439
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:21,580
我靠
I--pfft!

440
00:16:21,580 --> 00:16:25,340
我已经18年没在外工作了
I haven't done anything outside of my house in 18 years.

441
00:16:25,580 --> 00:16:28,140
我不想我干的第一件事就一败涂地
I don't want the first thing I do to be a complete failure.

442
00:16:29,180 --> 00:16:29,620
好吧
Okay.

443
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:33,460
我要给你讲个小女孩的故事
I'm gonna tell you a story about a little girl

444
00:16:34,184 --> 00:16:35,830
她去参加一次选美
who entered a beauty pageant...

445
00:16:35,980 --> 00:16:40,460
尽管她非常非常害怕失败
even though she was very, very scared that she was going to lose.

446
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:42,380
让我猜猜 你赢了
Let me guess. You won.

447
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:43,540
我当然赢了
Of course I won,

448
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:45,500
但我说的是我表妹玛丽亚·肯奇塔
But I was talking about my cousin Maria Conchita.

449
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:46,860
她鼻子大得像巨嘴鸟
She had a nose like a toucan.

450
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:48,900
非得把身体塞进比基尼里
She stuffed her body in this bikini.

451
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:51,340
最后 她光荣牺牲了
And at the end, she finished dead last.

452
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:54,280
这故事的启迪作用在哪儿
How is that a good story?

453
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:58,760
因为她直面恐惧 没被恐惧吓死
Because she faced her fears, and it didn't kill her.

454
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,660
她是两周后被一辆公交车撞死的
What killed her two weeks later was a bus.

455
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:04,140
有没有搞错啊你
Are you serious?

456
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:07,600
她那鼻子太大了挡视线 没看见车碾过来
Yes, because she couldn't see anything coming with that big nose.

457
00:17:08,660 --> 00:17:11,180
我的竞争对手赢过6次选举
This guy has won six elections.

458
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:12,460
我真是力不从心
I am way out of my league.

459
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:14,720
听着 我不了解你那竞争对手
Look, I don't know anything about this guy,

460
00:17:14,900 --> 00:17:17,020
但我知道你是个女强人
But I know that you're a tough lady,

461
00:17:17,060 --> 00:17:19,140
姐姐我从小就是在女强人家吓大的
and I come from a family of tough ladies.

462
00:17:19,140 --> 00:17:22,640
我必须承认 有时你的霸气绝对吓到我
And I have to say, sometimes you scare me a little bit.

463
00:17:22,940 --> 00:17:25,360
所以我坚信你必胜
And I know that you're strong enough to win

464
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:28,460
就算输了也会一笑而过
And definitely strong enough to be okay if you lose.

465
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:30,640
我有吓到你
I scare you?

466
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:31,900
那还用说
Are you kidding me?

467
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:34,880
今年感恩节要在老娘家过[上季剧情]
I want thanksgiving at my house!

468
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:36,900
为何人人都觉得我说话就是那样的
Why does everybody think I talk like that?

469
00:17:40,620 --> 00:17:41,760
就是这儿了
This is it.

470
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,720
等等 别急 我们有作战计划吗
W-w-wait. No, no. Come on. Do we have a plan?

471
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:47,440
貌似没计划好吧
It doesn't seem like we have a plan.

472
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:49,400
哥有计划 那小兔崽子要是不还钱
Yeah, I got a plan. Either he gives us the money,

473
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:52,940
就让他尝尝哥的哼哼哈嘿双截棍
Or he gets a private performance from England Dan and John Ford Coley.

474
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:54,860
你那算毛的好计划啊 那乐队本身就烂死了
That's not a good plan. That's not even a good band.

475
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:57,340
你要是只想唧唧歪歪 还是在车里等着吧
If all you're gonna do is criticize, just wait by the car.

476
00:17:57,760 --> 00:17:58,480
好吧
Okay, fine.

477
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:01,032
等我去探监你们吧
I'll see you in jail.

478
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,280
你俩可得花一大笔保释金
It's gonna be a big adjustment for two of you.

479
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,560
-什么事 -你是皮特吗
-Yeah? -You peter?

480
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,080
有何贵干
What do you want?

481
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:17,920
你认识海莉·邓菲吗 你欠她900块
You know haley dunphy? You owe her $900.

482
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:19,440
-我们是来收钱的 -明白吗
-We're here to collect. -You dig?

483
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,700
我给她打了N次电话了
I tried to call that girl, like, ten times,

484
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:23,890
但她语音信箱总是满的
But her voice mail was always... Full.

485
00:18:23,890 --> 00:18:25,340
确实挺像海莉的风格啊
That does sound like Haley.

486
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:26,820
那你打算怎么挽救啊
So how are you gonna make this right?

487
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:29,700
你们就是想要钱嘛 没问题
You guys want the money, right? That's fine.

488
00:18:29,700 --> 00:18:31,700
我也不想多费唇舌 等一下
I don't need any hassle. Hold on.

489
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:33,300
我这就去取钱
I'll just... grab it.

490
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,920
轻松搞定
That was easy.

491
00:18:39,500 --> 00:18:40,940
他倒是挺识趣 没敢动手
He's lucky he didn't put up a fight.

492
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:45,240
否则哥让他尝尝无影脚 倚天剑 加屠龙刀
I would've treated him to a reunion of Crosby, Stills, Nash, and Young!

493
00:18:47,664 --> 00:18:49,741
-那小子跑了 -抓住他
-We got a runner! -Runner!

494
00:18:49,783 --> 00:18:50,969
站住 站住
Stop! Stop!

495
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:51,340
站住
Stop!

496
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:57,020
别跑 别跑
No. No. No.

497
00:18:57,660 --> 00:18:58,160
别跑
No.

498
00:18:59,800 --> 00:19:00,960
我抓住他了
I got him!

499
00:19:00,980 --> 00:19:03,240
-天哪 你做到了 -别那么惊讶
-Oh, my god. You did! -Don't be so surprised.

500
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:05,640
快帮我 他要"金蝉脱裤"啦
Help! He's slipping out of his skinny jeans.

501
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:09,980
裤子好可爱哦 我也想要
These are cute. I totally have these.

502
00:19:14,123 --> 00:19:16,049
要回钱了
There you go!

503
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:18,120
你要回钱了 谢谢外公
Oh, you got it back! Thank you!

504
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:20,520
别谢我 谢你米奇尔舅舅
Hey, don't thank me. Thank your uncle Mitchell.

505
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,760
他才是擒贼英雄
He's the one who tackled the guy.

506
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:25,740
-我染上了光荣的草绿色 -好吧 我只能说
-I got grass stains. -Well, I will tell you one thing.

507
00:19:25,820 --> 00:19:27,600
我受到了深刻的教育
I have learned my lesson.

508
00:19:28,300 --> 00:19:30,200
让我的家人和朋友失望
Disappointing my family and friends

509
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:31,480
是对我最大的惩罚
is punishment enough.

510
00:19:31,660 --> 00:19:34,360
装得挺像 你还是得禁闭两周
Nice try. You're grounded for two weeks.

511
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:37,220
来吧 我们有个大新闻
Okay, we have big news.

512
00:19:37,940 --> 00:19:41,760
克莱尔最终决定参选镇长
Claire has decided to run for mayor after all.

513
00:19:41,795 --> 00:19:44,214
谢谢 实际上只是镇议员而已
Thank you, but it's town council.

514
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:46,280
无所谓职位 反正你也赢不了
It doesn't matter. You're not going to win anyways.

515
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:49,380
但她肯定会一笑而过的 看到了吗
But she's going to be okay. You see?

516
00:19:49,420 --> 00:19:51,000
我能帮助他人
I help the people.

517
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:53,420
为什么不让我助你们爷俩一臂之力呢
Why don't you two let me help you?

518
00:19:53,540 --> 00:19:54,980
我不知道杰是什么原因
Well, I can't speak for Jay,

519
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:58,560
我反正是因为自尊心太强 不想求助
But I guess I'm just too proud to ask for help.

520
00:19:58,593 --> 00:20:00,527
有没有搞错 你连牛排都求你妈来切
Are you serious? She cuts your steak.

521
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:01,600
那你呢
What about you?

522
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:03,460
我不想让生意上的事烦你
I don't want to bother you with my business.

523
00:20:03,980 --> 00:20:05,600
那我每天还能干点啥
What else do I do every day?

524
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:06,960
我不知道 我猜大概是去健身
I don't know. I'm guessing the gym.

525
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,960
还有 别的啥
And... One other thing?

526
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:12,220
爸 你应该听她的 或许她能帮到你哦
Dad, you should listen to her. She might really help you.

527
00:20:12,801 --> 00:20:14,941
她能帮上"大"忙呢[胸大臀大 资本"丰厚"]
She could be an asset.

528
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:18,280
-"资本" -听到了
-Asset. -Heard it.

529
00:20:20,078 --> 00:20:22,146
看看这些架子
And look at the shelves over here.

530
00:20:22,178 --> 00:20:25,345
可以放鞋 这些都是我的最爱哦
They're for the shoes. Those are my favorite ones.

531
00:20:25,560 --> 00:20:26,760
您觉得如何呢
So what do you think?

532
00:20:29,020 --> 00:20:29,620
哇哦
Wow!

533
00:20:33,220 --> 00:20:35,180
与之前的壁橱完全一样
Same... Exact... Closet.

534
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:37,050
想当年在农场我们不需要什么假身份证
We never needed fake I.D.S on the farm.

535
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:43,840
我们觉得如果16岁的孩子能开拖拉机
We figured if a 16-year-old could drive a tractor,

536
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:46,580
那喝啤酒肯定也没问题 当然不能一边喝一边开
He could drink a beer. Not at the same time, of course.

537
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:48,000
我们那儿是密苏里州 可不是德克萨斯
It's Missouri, not Texas.

538
00:20:48,031 --> 00:20:51,909
我用假身份证去租过一部重口味电影
I used a fake I.D. to get into an "R"-rated movie--

539
00:20:51,940 --> 00:20:53,400
《一曲相思情未了》
"The Fabulous Baker Boys."

540
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:55,700
我发现那片名简直是误导观众
I found the title to be misleading.

541
00:20:55,728 --> 00:20:57,865
米歇尔·法伊弗的镜头过多了 太坑爹了
Lot of Michelle Pfeiffer-- that's all I'm saying.

542
00:20:57,912 --> 00:20:59,992
我记得我也搞过假身份证
I remember when I got my fake I.D.

543
00:21:00,020 --> 00:21:01,560
我也是 年少轻狂
Me, too. Crazy times.

544
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:03,640
当年我想要应征入伍
Hell, yeah. I tried to enlist in the army,

545
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:05,640
结果被看穿了 之后我就跟一帮家伙们
But they saw right through me, so me and a bunch of guys

546
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:07,720
开车越过国境线 搞到一些烈酒
drove across state lines, we got a bunch of booze.

547
00:21:07,940 --> 00:21:10,640
我们边放烟火边豪饮 等我醒过来
We loaded up on fireworks, and I woke up in the morning--

548
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:13,380
不骗你们 我们居然是在一个墨西哥脱衣舞场
I kid you not-- in a mexican strip joint.

549
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:15,480
你呢
You?

550
00:21:16,048 --> 00:21:20,569
我用假身份证去借保龄球鞋 然后将之据为己有
Uh, I used mine to rent some bowling shoes and kept 'em.

551
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:21,500
那帮笨蛋大概会花好几个月时间
Suckers probably spent months

552
00:21:21,500 --> 00:21:23,480
去找那个所谓的理查德·赫兹博士
trying to track down Dr. Richard Hertz.

553
00:21:25,520 --> 00:21:26,860
多疯狂啊
Think about it.
